# NOTE: config.js IS committed on purpose. The Firebase web config is public by
# design -- it ships in the JavaScript of every Firebase web app. Security comes
# from firestore.rules and the authorized-domains list, not from hiding it.
# The Trello token in a later phase is a real secret and must never be added.
